# Jak 3: the Dark Maker ship's door that waits for a squad of troopers (LIST-0.1.9 item 27; a player: "a squad of
# enemies that must be killed in order for a door to open seemingly don't spawn"). Run with JAKVR_TEST_TASK=64
# (precursor-tour) JAKVR_TEST_WARP=precur-door-b QUEST_SIM_ALIGN=10000 JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1: a new game into play (as
# jak3_vehicle_hands.sim), the task's continue, then Jak put 2 m from the nearest of the ship's doors (frame 10000).
# Jak is held there until every level the game wants is up (5 s at most; build 127c's warp came before precurb, the
# floor there, and he fell). From then pc-vr.gc vr-test-watch! logs Jak's place and every actor within 40 m every
# 2 seconds for 30 s ("[vr-test] watch:", each with its state, or none-born or no-state, and its perm bits): the
# door's troopers (dp-bipedal-123 to 126, 16 to 31 m off, dormant-aware ambushers) must wake and come; on build 127c
# they stood in process-drawable-art-error (born before precurb, which holds their nav mesh). Pictures as he looks
# round.
